---
// The v2 key hierarchy from docs/CRYPTO.md and docs/ARCHITECTURE.md on main.
---
<div class="keytree" aria-label="Key hierarchy">
  <div class="kn"><span class="box root">Master passphrase</span><span class="note">never stored</span></div>
  <div class="edge"><span>Argon2id, 64 MiB or more, 3 passes → WrapKek</span></div>
  <div class="kn"><span class="box">RootSecret · 256-bit</span><span class="note">memory-only while unlocked; also wrapped by an independent recovery secret into the Recovery Kit</span></div>
  <div class="edge"><span>HKDF-SHA256, salt = vault_id</span></div>
  <div class="leaves">
    <div class="kn"><span class="box">vault-dek · audit-dek · sync-dek</span><span class="note">seal the vault, audit log and sync payload</span></div>
    <div class="kn"><span class="box">sync-ed25519 + sync-mldsa</span><span class="note">hybrid sync identity, both must verify</span></div>
    <div class="kn"><span class="box">share-x25519 + share-mlkem</span><span class="note">hybrid share identity, ML-KEM-768</span></div>
    <div class="kn"><span class="box">search-hmac</span><span class="note">blinded search, optional</span></div>
  </div>
</div>
<style>
  .keytree { font-family: var(--mono); font-size: .8rem; display: grid; color: var(--mist); }
  .kn { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: .9rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .box { border: 1px solid var(--line-dark); background: var(--slate); border-radius: 7px; padding: .55rem .8rem; }
  .box.root { border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--blue) 60%, var(--line-dark)); color: var(--blue); }
  .note { color: var(--mist-2); font-size: .72rem; font-family: var(--font); max-width: 22rem; }
  .edge { height: 22px; width: 1px; background: var(--line-dark); margin-left: 1.25rem; position: relative; }
  .edge span { position: absolute; left: 1rem; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); white-space: nowrap; font-size: .7rem; color: var(--mist-2); }
  .leaves { display: grid; gap: .45rem; padding-left: 1.25rem; border-left: 1px solid var(--line-dark); margin-left: 1.25rem; }
  .leaves .kn { position: relative; }
  .leaves .kn::before { content: ""; position: absolute; left: -1.25rem; top: 50%; width: 1rem; height: 1px; background: var(--line-dark); }
</style>
